ugh weight it  is her responsibility to help him no  matter what they take part in the  marathon and complete it with all their  might in the end kolya gathers enough  courage to kiss her for the first time  in her life anya realizes that obsessing  about her appearance will not make her  happy true happiness lies in accepting  yourself as you are like colya did he  always worked hard to improve his health  but was never ashamed of his appearance  anya strives to be like him subscribe  for more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

